"conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"    如图形势，红右车迅即出动，准备移左攻虚，是大局感极强的好棋。","text":"    如图形势，红右车迅即出动，准备移左攻虚，是大局感极强的好棋。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"    红车左移逼退黑马后，黑调车过河企图牵制红方的后续部队。红却放任黑车吃马，扑出左马攻王，着法有力。黑如不吃马改走车7退1，则马六进四，攻势亦很强盛。","text":"    红车左移逼退黑马后，黑调车过河企图牵制红方的后续部队。红却放任黑车吃马，扑出左马攻王，着法有力。黑如不吃马改走车7退1，则马六进四，攻势亦很强盛。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"    红胜。||","text":"    红胜。\n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["099云南何连生 先胜 甘肃钱洪发"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第三章 中炮对其它（26局）"],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["未知"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["B10 中炮对单提马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":24,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":37,"legal_move_records":37,"annotations":5,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":5}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第三章 中炮对其它 云南何连生 先胜 甘肃钱洪发","catalogue_order":90,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-4.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-